{
 "id": "person-ester-orchestral",
 "song": "/Users/vhanssen/WebstormProjects/flogvit/music/YuE/outputs/catalog/person-ester-orchestral",
 "offset_seconds": -3.4800000000001816,
 "words_heard": 244,
 "words": 250,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "An orphan girl in Susa, raised by Mordecai's hand",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Was chosen for the palace, crowned a queen at the king's command",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But Haman cast the lot and had the king's decree sent out",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To wipe away the Jews in every province round about",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Mordecai sat at the gate in sackcloth and in tears",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He sent his word to Esther and he would not spare her fears",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Do not imagine that you alone of all the Jews will escape",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Because you are in the king's house",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If you keep silent at a time like this",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Relief and deliverance will arise for the Jews from another place",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And who knows?",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 3,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Perhaps you have come to the throne",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For just such a time as this",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Go, gather all the Jews in Susa and fast for me",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then I will go to the king, even though it is against the law",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And if I perish, I perish",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "On the third day in royal robes she stood before the throne",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The whole court held its breath to see if she would stand alone",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The king held out the golden scepter, she found favor in his eyes",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And on the gallows Haman built, the wicked Haman died",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If you keep silent at a time like this",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Relief and deliverance will arise for the Jews from another place",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And who knows?",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 3,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Perhaps you have come to the throne",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For just such a time as this",
   "heard": 7,
